  {
   "id": "matematicas-2021-reserva-1-8",
   "n": 8,
   "bloque": "B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\dfrac{x-2}{-2}=y-1=\\dfrac z{-2}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+2y=3\\\\2y+z=2\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Estudia la posición relativa de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula, si es posible, el plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y a \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): \\(R(2,1,0)\\), \\(\\vec d_r=(-2,1,-2)\\). \\(s\\): dirección \\((1,2,0)\\times(0,2,1)=(2,-1,2)=-\\vec d_r\\): las direcciones son proporcionales, luego \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) son paralelas o coincidentes. ¿\\(R\\in s\\)? \\(2+2\\cdot1=4\\neq3\\): no.</p><div class='res'>Las rectas son paralelas (distintas)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Dos rectas paralelas distintas determinan un plano. Punto de \\(s\\) (con \\(y=1\\)): \\(S(1,1,0)\\). Vectores del plano: \\(\\vec d_r=(-2,1,-2)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-1,0,0)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d_r\\times\\overrightarrow{RS}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&1&-2\\\\-1&0&0\\end{vmatrix}=(0,\\,2,\\,1)\\]\\[2y+z+D=0\\ \\text{por }R(2,1,0):\\ 2+D=0\\Rightarrow D=-2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":35,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.4,-0.968,3.937],[5.0,-0.968,3.937],[5.0,2.168,-2.337],[-0.4,2.168,-2.337]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[5.0,2.168,-2.337],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[3.6,0.2,1.6],[0.0,2.0,-2.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,2.0,-2.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[4.6,-0.8,3.6],[1.0,1.0,0.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,1.0,0.0],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1.4,1.3,-0.6],[0.733,1.633,-1.267],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[2.5,0.5,1.0],[2.5,1.752,1.626],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[2,1,0],\"R\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,0,2],\"S\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n518n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n518d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n518g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n518r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='112.7,18.0 26.0,64.4 97.9,246.0 184.6,199.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='101.9' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='75.3' y1='120.0' x2='174.3' y2='193.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='180.3' y='193.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='36.3' y1='70.7' x2='135.3' y2='144.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='141.3' y='144.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='135.8' y1='164.8' x2='154.1' y2='178.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#n518d)'/><text x='158.1' y='174.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='99.8' y1='127.9' x2='128.5' y2='119.2' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#n518n)'/><text x='132.5' y='115.2' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><circle cx='119.3' cy='152.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='126.3' y='146.6' font-weight='700'>R</text><circle cx='80.3' cy='103.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='87.3' y='97.3' font-weight='700'>S</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.8' y2='274.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.6' y='280.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.1' y2='273.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='38.7' y='278.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(2y+z-2=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(S\\): \\(2+0-2=0\\) ✓ y es una de las ecuaciones de \\(s\\).</i></div>"
